SUMMARY:All of It: A Dance of Gratitude - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Stacey Bu
 tcher
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, November 27th\nEvening
  Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\n
 Guest DJ Stacey Butcher \\| Support Facilitator Kristikka\n\nIntention: **
 All of It: A Dance of Gratitude**\n\nCan we be grateful for all of it? Not
  just the beautiful moments\, the easy relationships\, and the things that
  go according to plan. But also the messy\, uncomfortable\, unexpected\, a
 nd unfinished parts of being human? This dance invites us to move with the
  fullness of our experience. To honor what has been\, celebrate what is\, 
 and make room for all that is still unfolding. Gratitude doesn't mean ever
 ything is wonderful. It means we're willing to meet the richness and compl
 exity of being alive.\n\n## About Stacey Butcher\n\nStacey Butcher is an O
 pen Floor movement teacher\, serving on the faculty of Open Floor Internat
 ional\, and a Certified 5Rhythms teacher (trained by Gabrielle Roth). She 
 is also a Somatic Experiencing Practitioner (SEP)\, Integral Somatic Psych
 ology practitioner\, and a Reiki Master/Teacher. Stacey has been dedicated
  to the healing arts for over 25 years and has studied with healers and te
 achers from around the world. Her teaching is infused with passion\, deep 
 presence and humor. She is an inspirational facilitator and is skilled at 
 holding space for transformation. For more info\, visit her website at [ht
 tp://www.staceybutcher.com/](http://www.staceybutcher.com/).\n\\~\\~\\~\n\
 n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close prom
 ptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please 
 be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $
 15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre
 -registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer 
 and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementc
 ollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/voluntee
 r/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkED
 IyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELh
 DttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor
  will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY 
 AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashev
 illemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective
 .org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNyd
 GMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwg
 nJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAshevil
 le Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all a
 re free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our missio
 n and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-f
 orm dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation
 . AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Ash
 eville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!**All of It: A Dance of Gr
 atitude**
