SUMMARY:Thanks!! - Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Ted Riskin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, November 29th\n1st Dan
 ce Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance
  Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilita
 tor Ted Riskin\n\nIntention: Thanks!!\n\nLet’s dedicate our dance today 
 to something or someone we are thankful for.\n\n## About Ted Riskin\n\nTed
  is interested in anything that can get him out of his head\, and music an
 d movement do a pretty good job of that. He hopes to offer music that faci
 litates an inner journey and invitations that create a shift. While he lik
 es modern electronic music\, he can’t create a mix without including lot
 s of natural instruments and voices. Due to a short attention span\, he mi
 xes in lots of different musical genres. You can hear some of his mixes on
  [https://www.mixcloud.com/tarisk/](https://www.mixcloud.com/tarisk/)\n\\~
 \\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors c
 lose promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away
 . Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket 
 Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of fu
