SUMMARY:The Blessings of Becoming - Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Jeannie Adair
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, December 6th\n1st Danc
 e Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance 
 Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitat
 or Jeannie Adair\n\nIntention: **The Blessings of Becoming**\n\n"Thanks to
  impermanence\, everything is possible."\n-Thich Nhat Hanh\n\nAs the year 
 turns\, we gather to honor all that has shaped us\, the beauty and the bre
 aking\, the joy and the sorrows.\nLet's loosen our hold on the familiar an
 d open ourselves to the mystery of what is unfolding\, dancing at the thre
 shold of the unknown to celebrate the blessings of becoming.\n\n## About J
 eannie Adair\n\nJeannie is a mixed media artist\, experience designer & mo
 vement medicine evangelist. She curates soulful journeys that invite emoti
 onal release & authentic connection. An AMC facilitator since 2023\, she
 ’s here to hold space with intention\, care\, and a loving heart. Find h
 er ecstatic dance mixes on Soundcloud at [https://soundcloud.com/dancingle
 ontine](https://soundcloud.com/dancingleontine) and her artwork on Instagr
 am: [https://www.instagram.com/leontine.creative/](https://www.instagram.c
 om/leontine.creative/)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance s
 tarts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that 
 come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secu
 re container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo o
 ne turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNT
 EER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volu
 nteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://as
 hevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBEx
 MFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH
 1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAf
 A)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the 
 opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\n
 Collective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance
 /](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0
 CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAA
 R4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdV
 B1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a w
 orld that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves
  within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticit
 y and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for
  personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organ
 ization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the 
 dance floor!
