 rs to be fully themselves?\nCan I feel the beauty of belonging to somethin
 g larger while remaining entirely myself?\n\n## About Bob Swoap\n\nBob cra
 fts journeys that invite dancers to deeply connect: with themselves\, othe
 rs\, nature\, and the music. He layers genres and world rhythms into an em
 otionally engaging set. At Warren Wilson College -- where he is professor 
 of psychology and expressive arts therapy -- Bob facilitates ecstatic danc
 e as a part of the community wellness program\, bringing a grounded\, expe
 rienced presence to the floor. Favorite place to dance: outside at the WWC
  Pavilion.\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm 
